# Exclude agentic-coding and IDE tooling from 'git archive' output (GitHub release
# tarballs). These are developer/contributor tooling, not part of the shell
# bootloader koopa ships to end users. Does not affect 'git clone' -- contributors
# still get the full tree.
#
# The koopa Claude Code / Copilot CLI plugin lives entirely under plugins/koopa/,
# a path never touched by any rule below, so it always ships regardless of these
# ignores. (An earlier draft needed .claude/skills/ and .github/plugin/ to ship
# too, for a since-cut "koopa-dev" plugin -- if that idea returns, note that
# 'export-ignore' on a directory blocks git from ever descending into it, so a
# later '-export-ignore' override on a subpath is not honored; each exception
# has to be listed individually instead of via a parent-directory pattern.)
.claude/             export-ignore
.agents/             export-ignore
.idea/               export-ignore
.github/             export-ignore
CLAUDE.md            export-ignore
AGENTS.md            export-ignore
.claudeignore        export-ignore
todo.org             export-ignore
koopa.code-workspace export-ignore
